{geni:about_me} Something I Remember About My Grandmother.

I remember her smile, I remember her voice , I remember her love.

I remember her Cows :) She loved blue, she loved her friends. Barbara, and Betty, Charles, and Mike, and Lori. She loved my Grandpa Forest. She loved sizzler, and Okra, and Gumbo, and Jazz music. 94.7 KSSJ, specifically ! :)

I remember she loved to fish, I remember she loved camping, and cruises, and traveling.

Once I asked my grandma, " How is it that you are able to do so many wonderful things, that are expensive for many people?" She said I have a wonderful Father.',NULL,NULL),
