{geni:about_me} McWillmer Daggs aka "Sorty" was born on September 5, 1926 in Hammond, LA to George and Mabel Daggs. He was their wecond born child.

He moved to San Francisco at the age of nine.

He was an active member of the choir, the Usher Board, and sang in a former gospel quartet, " The sons of sonlight"

He loved cowboy movies, he work as furniture upholstere for many years and also had a detailing business.
