{geni:about_me} Mable Katie Harts Daggs was born to the union of the late Oscar and Evengelina Harts on april 11, 1917 in New Orleans, Louisiana. She moves to Hamond, Louisiana at the age of ten, where she attended public school.

Married George B. Daggs in 1934, and they had five children. One daughter preceded her in death.

The family moved to San Francisco , CA in 1944

She was a licensed missionary, and served as Senior Mother of the Church  and was President of the Mission Board at Sonlight Pentecostal Christian Center',NULL,NULL),
