{geni:about_me} She was an only child.

In the early 40''s she moved to San Francisco, CA .

Married Elder L.O. Watkins, who preceded her in death, and she later married Isiah Rhodes.

She was interested in civic and community affairs, she coordinated the food program at her church, where hundreds of people were served each month.

She was a District Missionary and State Field Representative for the Northern California First Jurisdiction State Sunday School in 1980

She was very close to Evelyn Stephens, mother of Gloria Tynes. They were raised together like sisters.  So, Gloria called her "Aint',NULL,NULL),
